{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e6c8d805948bb8520bea7b4f3d55c196c681e0a99f23cc2e97ea0951b1dd728f", "ja": "（今日は瑞希のコスプレグラビア企画の撮影だ。\nテーマは『キツネ娘』。瑞希も既に張り切っている）", "zh": "（今天是瑞希的狐女角色写真企划拍摄。主题是“狐娘”。瑞希似乎也已经干劲十足了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "20662343c4b6d2e1e2f8a890683f9f7c20547ef2ad988c8ab4ffcc3a91813880", "ja": "{$P$}、見てください。\nキツネの瑞希。略してミズキツネです。", "zh": "{$P$}，请看。\n狐狸瑞希。简称“瑞狐狸”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3543d964fe0b958431817c88bd85a3b1a2a249d00ba92e2c7ef3937dd56fcdf8", "ja": "おお、いい感じだな瑞希。\nよく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "哦，感觉很不错啊，瑞希。\n很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "07e3465b8c039cf6d98e527b75601b07429c2799f8850468e396760e7f0b27d4", "ja": "本当ですか。ありがとうございます。\nこの勢いで、撮影がんばるぞ。コンコン。", "zh": "真的吗？谢谢您。\n就保持这个势头，努力拍摄吧。咚咚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4c9ad18420512197fc1632577f22994a3a84720264dcbea7c16fc75ef63c69b1", "ja": "おお。気合いが入ってるみたいだな。\nうん！　本番もこの調子でいこう！", "zh": "哦，看来干劲十足啊。\n嗯！正式演出也要保持这个状态！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "8fc57175c0b4da8973279b7cd44ba19f35c6bdec943b4b283460c8ade556f0fd", "ja": "はい。キツネは頭に葉っぱを乗せて、変身します。\n私もキツネの力を借りて、変身マジックを披露……。", "zh": "是的。狐狸会把叶子顶在头上，然后变身。\n我也要借助狐狸的力量，表演变身魔术……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "e8ae41ab3f5ea3c9c7e8d856b935d71003d04d445c27694f116a9f650f245977", "ja": "……は、準備が間に合わず。ですが、カワイイキツネに\n変身する気持ちで、がんばります……コン。", "zh": "……这招，因为准备没赶上。但是，我会带着\n变身成可爱狐狸的心情，努力加油的……嗷呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1fa2edbbb32d7e5e2a4ec371098fb29c084173f6bcee20979fc7bb30322e6222", "ja": "ん？　そんなに意気込まなくても\n変身は成功してると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯？我觉得就算不用那么使劲，\n你也已经成功变身了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9c579d334f309dafcc9744b31f36015302d705dceb2785bc25d386748f95d937", "ja": "今のままでも、十分かわいいと思うし、\nキツネ娘の魅力が伝わってくるよ。", "zh": "我觉得就保持现在这样，已经足够可爱了，也能传达出狐娘的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "00bccabb12a089d316f78a853e7bd6513a87520824e79a6d857ec6c850ae3511", "ja": "そ、そうですか。{$P$}のお墨付き、\nすごく嬉しいです。……ドキドキ。", "zh": "是、是吗？能得到{$P$}的认可，我真的很开心……好紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fef4c96525f1aee77ee2447ff989534418211754d1e1fbab03bf57fa07e23c2d", "ja": "うん、照れてる感じもバッチリだ！", "zh": "嗯，害羞的感觉也很到位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "e410f4c19600058fedc564c925b41af24f2052a19d15f40eac235a34f0a03846", "ja": "！！　なんと。キツネが獲物を仕留めるように\n私も狙い撃ちされてしまいました。……ずきゅん。", "zh": "！！竟然。就像狐狸捕获猎物一样，我也被瞄准射中了。……心里砰地一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "139ddad2e21784f49b6385d9385db4a8701f86d2bb010d4b5e37c3435eaea1ff", "ja": "今日は{$P$}に、たくさん\n褒めてもらえたので、いい仕事ができそうです。", "zh": "今天能得到{$P$}的许多夸奖，感觉一定能好好完成工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1014_p", "source_sha256": "dbfc7b97a60133c31e9dfdb6ef0dccf2e444095d8556c0d31f09296aa1e9a914", "ja": "ははっ。これくらいお安い御用だよ。\n……おっ。そろそろ移動の時間だな。", "zh": "哈哈，这点小事不在话下。\n……哦，差不多该出发了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "04cb3146bd048730d7f930407c4a328916ddfde7dc562050479dbd20869311f0", "ja": "わかりました。\nそれでは行ってきます、{$P$}。", "zh": "明白了。\n那么我先出发了，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0593_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "fb4686cc12cf5b01ae6e21c0398026362152e90d0aff7c0d362fa6413bcadde6", "ja": "アイドル界の大自然を駆け巡る、ミズキツネのキュート\nな姿をお届けするために。……えいえい、おう。", "zh": "为了向大家展现驰骋于偶像界大自然中的瑞希狐可爱\n身姿。……加油，加油，冲呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
